Wed Oct  7 18:40:00 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- TCP BBR + fq qdisc (sysctl, tcp_bbr via modules-load.d)
- Transparent huge pages: defrag=defer+madvise via tmpfiles.d
- Nvidia modprobe options: PAT, no memory zeroing, RMIntrLockingMode,
  nvidia_drm modeset=1 fbdev=1
- Persistent journal limited to 200 MB

